System.Messaging
----------------

This product includes software from the .NET Framework 4.8 Reference Source
(https://github.com/microsoft/referencesource, commit ec9fa9a), licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) Microsoft
Corporation: System.Messaging (System.Messaging/), and the shared files its build compiled in from elsewhere in the
Reference Source (System.Configuration/misc/externdll.cs, System.Xml/InternalApis/Clr/inc/AppContextDefaultValues.cs
and LocalAppContext.cs, System/misc/invariantcomparer.cs).

It is in the external/referencesource submodule (https://github.com/xforcore/referencesource, branch
messagingforcore), compiled by src/messagingForCore.System.Messaging; each file keeps its original header, and every
change is a commit on that branch. The assembly carries System.Messaging's public key (token b03f5f7f11d50a3a,
keys/System.Messaging.snk) so that references to it resolve; it is public signed, not signed by Microsoft.

